        <text>
          <content>
            <paragraph align="center">○丙申/命集賢殿校理<index id="p16_000057_00" num="0198319_0" ref="M_0058307" sort="K" type="이름">崔恒</index>、副校理<index id="p16_000058_00" num="0198320_0" ref="M_0002656" sort="K" type="이름">朴彭年</index>、副修撰<index id="p17_000070_00" num="0198321_0" ref="M_0003129" sort="K" type="이름">申叔舟</index>ㆍ<index num="0198322_0" ref="M_0004499" sort="K" type="이름">李善老</index>ㆍ<index id="p16_000067_00" num="0198323_0" ref="M_0000431" sort="K" type="이름">李塏</index>、敦寧府注簿<index id="p16_000080_00" num="0198324_0" ref="M_0001027" sort="K" type="이름">姜希顔</index>等, 詣議事廳, 以諺文譯<index num="0198325_0" type="서명">《韻會》</index>, 東宮與<index num="0198326_0" ref="M_0047665" sort="K" type="이름">晉陽大君</index>
              <index num="0198327_0" ref="M_0047665" sort="K" type="이름">瑈</index>、<index num="0198328_0" ref="M_0042246" sort="K" type="이름">安平大君</index>
              <index num="0198329_0" ref="M_0042246" sort="K" type="이름">瑢</index>監掌其事。 皆稟睿斷, 賞賜稠重, 供億優厚矣。</paragraph>
          </content>
